<section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '1', title: 'Your Feet Carry You All Day. Give Them 15 Minutes Back.' %}<div class="airrelief-two">{% if section.settings.story_image != blank %}<div>{{ section.settings.story_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.story_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="airrelief-copy"><p>Long shifts. Hours of standing. Walking. Workouts. Travel.</p><p>By the end of the day, your feet can feel tight, puffy, sore and heavy — especially around the ankle where ordinary foot massagers often don’t reach.</p><p>AirRelief wraps around both the foot and ankle to deliver a relaxing combination of rhythmic compression, warming heat and vibration exactly where tired feet need it most.</p><p class="apdp-massager-highlight">Strap it on. Sit back. Let your feet finally switch off.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '2', title: 'Three Therapies. One Deeper Reset.' %}<div class="apdp-massager-grid"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Air Compression</h3><p>Rhythmic squeeze-and-release pressure surrounds the foot and ankle to help relieve puffiness, heaviness and built-up tension.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Warming Heat</h3><p>Soothing warmth helps stiff, overworked areas loosen and relax. 4 adjustable heat levels.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>High-Frequency Vibration</h3><p>Targeted vibration helps release tightness after standing, walking or training. 4 vibration levels.</p></article></div>{% if section.settings.mechanism_image != blank %}<div class="airrelief-copy">{{ section.settings.mechanism_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.mechanism_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}<p class="apdp-massager-highlight">Compression moves. Heat loosens. Vibration relaxes.</p><p class="airrelief-copy">Together, they deliver a more complete reset than heat or massage alone.</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '3', title: 'The Relief Your Feet Have Been Asking For' %}<div class="apdp-massager-grid airrelief-four"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Feel Lighter After Long Days</h3><p>Rhythmic compression helps relieve the puffy, heavy feeling that can build up after hours on your feet.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Loosen Tight, Stiff Ankles</h3><p>Heat and vibration work together to help overworked areas feel warmer, softer and easier to relax.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Soothe End-of-Day Aches</h3><p>Give tired feet a calming reset after work, walking, workouts or travel.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Choose the Pressure You Want</h3><p>With 5 intensity levels, start gentle and increase the compression when you want a deeper squeeze.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '4', title: 'From Morning Walks to 12-Hour Shifts' %}<p class="airrelief-copy">Built for the moments when your feet have simply done enough.</p><div class="apdp-massager-grid airrelief-four"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Long Hours Standing</h3><p>Ideal after retail shifts, nursing, teaching, hospitality, warehouse work, cooking, delivery work or any day spent mostly on your feet.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Walking &amp; Travel</h3><p>Give heavy feet a break after sightseeing, commuting, airport days or long walks.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Training &amp; Recovery</h3><p>Use after running, gym sessions or active days when your feet and ankles feel worked.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>Evening Wind-Down</h3><p>Slip it on while watching TV, reading or relaxing before bed.</p></article></div><p class="apdp-massager-highlight">Work · Walk · Train · Travel · Recover</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '5', title: 'More Than Heat. More Convenient Than a Foot Spa.' %}<p class="airrelief-copy">AirRelief combines compression, warmth and vibration in one wearable device. Typical alternatives vary by model.</p><div class="airrelief-comparison" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Compare massage options; scroll horizontally on small screens"><table><caption class="visually-hidden">Foot comfort options</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Altaeron AirRelief</th><th scope="col">Heating Pad</th><th scope="col">Compression Socks</th><th scope="col">Foot Spa</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Air compression</th><td>✓</td><td>—</td><td>Passive only</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Warming heat</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vibration massage</th><td>✓</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Varies by model</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Foot + ankle coverage</th><td>✓</td><td>Partial</td><td>✓</td><td>Mostly foot</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Adjustable intensity</th><td>✓</td><td>Limited</td><td>—</td><td>Limited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cordless</th><td>✓</td><td>Sometimes</td><td>✓</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Easy while relaxing</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>Requires setup</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="airrelief-copy">Why settle for one type of relief when your feet can have all three?</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '6', title: 'Your Massage. Your Intensity.' %}<p class="airrelief-copy">Not every tired foot needs the same treatment. Personalize each session with adjustable compression, heat and vibration.</p><div class="apdp-massager-grid airrelief-four"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>3 Air Compression Cycles</h3><p>Switch between different compression rhythms.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>5 Compression Intensity Levels</h3><p>Go from a gentle squeeze to deeper pressure.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>4 Heat Levels</h3><p>Choose the soothing warmth that feels right.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>4 Vibration Levels</h3><p>Adjust from lighter relaxation to a stronger massage sensation.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '7', title: 'Relief in 3 Simple Steps' %}<div class="apdp-massager-grid"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>1 · Wrap</h3><p>Place AirRelief around your foot and ankle, then secure the adjustable hook-and-loop strap.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>2 · Choose</h3><p>Select your preferred compression cycle and intensity, then adjust heat and vibration to your comfort.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>3 · Relax</h3><p>Sit back for around 15 minutes and let AirRelief do the work.</p></article></div><p class="apdp-massager-highlight">No soaking. No rolling. No massage gun to hold. Just put it on and relax.</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '8', title: 'What 15 Minutes Can Feel Like' %}<div class="apdp-massager-grid"><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>First Few Minutes</h3><p>Warmth builds as compression begins its steady squeeze-and-release rhythm.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>By the End of the Session</h3><p>Tight, overworked areas can feel warmer, looser and less heavy.</p></article><article class="apdp-massager-card"><h3>After Long Days</h3><p>That “I need to get off my feet” feeling can turn into a more comfortable evening.</p></article></div><p class="airrelief-copy">No appointment. No soaking. No complicated recovery routine.</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '9', title: 'Your Foot Massage Doesn’t Need a Power Outlet.' %}<div class="airrelief-copy"><p>A built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery keeps your relaxation from being tied to one chair or room. Use it on the sofa, at your desk, in bed, while traveling or after training.</p><p>A full charge provides approximately 1–2 hours of total use, depending on the settings selected. At around 15 minutes per session, one charge can cover several sessions.</p><p class="apdp-massager-highlight">Recharge. Strap on. Relax anywhere.</p></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '10', title: 'Adjustable Comfort for Different Feet' %}<div class="airrelief-copy"><p>The flexible wrap adapts to different foot and ankle shapes. A secure hook-and-loop closure lets you adjust the fit until it feels comfortably snug without constantly slipping or needing to be held in place.</p><p class="apdp-massager-highlight">Secure. Adjustable. Easy to wear.</p></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '11', title: 'Made for Feet That Work Hard' %}<div class="airrelief-copy"><p>For feet that feel heavy after standing, puffy by evening, stiff after sitting or travel, sore after walking, tight after exercise, cold or overworked after long shifts.</p><p>If your favorite moment of the day is finally taking your shoes off, AirRelief was made for that moment.</p></div></div></section><section id="AltaeronMedicalReview-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-expert alta-pdp-flow-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '12', title: 'Medical Review' %}<div class="apdp-expert__panel airrelief-expert"><div class="airrelief-portrait">{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_portrait != blank %}{{ section.settings.reviewer_portrait | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.reviewer_portrait.alt | default: product.title }} {% else %}{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}{% endif %}</div><div class="apdp-expert__profile"><small>{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_name != blank %}Reviewed by{% else %}Massage methods &amp; everyday comfort{% endif %}</small>{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_name != blank %}<h3>{{ section.settings.reviewer_name | escape }}</h3><p>{{ section.settings.reviewer_credentials | escape }}</p>{% else %}<h3>Compression · Warmth · Vibration</h3><p>Independent medical review pending. General product information; no clinician endorsement is claimed.</p>{% endif %}</div><blockquote><p>{{ section.settings.medical_body | escape }}</p></blockquote><div class="apdp-expert__criteria"><p>AirRelief brings these three massage methods into one wearable device, making it easy to add a short relaxation session to an everyday routine without a bulky foot spa or handheld massage tool.</p><p>Designed for relaxation and post-activity comfort. It is not intended to diagnose, treat or cure a medical condition.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '13', title: 'Product Specifications' %}<table class="airrelief-specs"><caption class="visually-hidden">AirRelief specifications</caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">System</th><td>Air compression + warming heat + high-frequency vibration</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Compression</th><td>3 programmable cycles · 5 intensity levels</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heat</th><td>4 heat levels</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vibration</th><td>4 vibration levels</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Session</th><td>Approximately 15 minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Battery</th><td>1200mAh rechargeable lithium battery</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rated voltage / power</th><td>DC 3.7V / 5W</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Charging / runtime</th><td>Approximately 3 hours / 1–2 hours depending on settings</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dimensions</th><td>Approximately 20 × 17 × 4 cm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Material</th><td>Soft technical / OK cloth + ABS control housing</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Color</th><td>Black</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fit</th><td>Adjustable hook-and-loop wrap</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="airrelief-copy"><strong>In the box:</strong> 1 × Altaeron AirRelief massager unit with controls, charging cable, instruction manual and packaging box.</p></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section apdp-tail apdp-tail-faq"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '14', title: 'Frequently Asked Questions' %}<div class="apdp-tail-accordion"><details><summary>How long should I use AirRelief?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>A typical session is around 15 minutes, making it easy to use after work, walking, exercise or anytime your feet feel tired and overworked.</p></details><details><summary>Does AirRelief massage both the foot and ankle?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief wraps around the foot and ankle, allowing compression, warmth and vibration to work around both areas.</p></details><details><summary>How strong is the compression?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>You can choose from 5 intensity levels, so you can start with a gentler squeeze and increase the pressure to your comfort.</p></details><details><summary>How many compression modes are there?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief offers 3 programmable air-compression cycles so you can change the rhythm of the massage.</p></details><details><summary>How many heat levels does it have?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief provides 4 adjustable heat levels so you can choose the amount of warmth that feels best.</p></details><details><summary>How many vibration levels does it have?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief provides 4 vibration levels, letting you adjust the massage sensation from lighter relaxation to a stronger feel.</p></details><details><summary>Can compression, heat and vibration be used together?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief combines air compression, warming heat and vibration to create a more complete foot-and-ankle massage experience.</p></details><details><summary>Can I walk while wearing AirRelief?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief is best used while sitting, reclining or resting so the wrap stays comfortably positioned and you can fully relax during the session.</p></details><details><summary>Is AirRelief cordless?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief uses a built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery, so you can use it without staying connected to a power outlet.</p></details><details><summary>How long does the battery last?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>A full charge provides approximately 1–2 hours of total use, depending on the settings selected.</p></details><details><summary>Will it fit my foot?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>The adjustable hook-and-loop design accommodates a range of foot and ankle shapes and lets you adjust how snug the wrap feels.</p></details><details><summary>When is the best time to use it?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Use AirRelief after long work shifts, walking, travel, workouts or during your evening wind-down whenever your feet feel heavy, tight or tired.</p></details><details><summary>What if it isn't right for me?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>You're covered by Altaeron's 30-Day Comfort Guarantee. Try AirRelief during your normal routine and contact us within the guarantee period if it isn't right for you.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-massager-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-massager-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '15', title: 'Try AirRelief at Home for 30 Days' %}<div class="apdp-massager-guarantee">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}<div><p>Your feet should feel better after using your massager — not make you wonder whether you wasted your money.</p><p>Try Altaeron AirRelief at home after work, walking, workouts or during your evening routine. If it isn’t the relaxing foot-and-ankle reset you expected, you’re covered by our 30-Day Comfort Guarantee.</p></div><a class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" href="#AirReliefFinal-{{ section.id }}">TRY AIRRELIEF AT HOME →</a></div><p class="airrelief-copy">Secure Checkout · Free &amp; Tracked Shipping · 30-Day Comfort Guarantee</p></div></section><section id="AltaeronVerified-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-shell apdp-review-summary"{% if review_count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}><h2>AirRelief Customer Reviews</h2><div id="judgeme_product_reviews" class="jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget" data-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" data-widget="review" data-auto-install="false" data-entry-point="review_widget.js" data-entry-key="review-widget/main.js"></div>{% if product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data %}<script>window.jdgm=window.jdgm||{};window.jdgm.data=window.jdgm.data||{};window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget=window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget||{};window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget[{{ product.id | json }}]={{ product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data }};</script>{% endif %}</section><section id="AirReliefFinal-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-final-cta alta-pdp-flow-section"><div class="apdp-shell airrelief-two">{% if section.settings.final_cta_image != blank %}<div>{{ section.settings.final_cta_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.final_cta_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div><h2>Your Feet Have Done Enough for Today.</h2><p>Your feet carried you through the day. Now give them 15 minutes back.</p><p><strong>Compression. Heat. Vibration.</strong></p><p>No appointment. No soaking. No massage gun to hold.</p><h3>{{ product.title | escape }}</h3><div class="apdp-price"><strong data-apdp-final-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</strong><s data-apdp-final-compare{% if current_compare <= current_variant.price %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ current_compare | money }}</s></div><button type="button" class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" data-apdp-final-submit{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>GIVE MY FEET 15 MINUTES<span data-apdp-final-button-price> — {{ current_variant.price | money }}</span></button><p>Free &amp; Tracked Shipping · 30-Day Comfort Guarantee</p></div></div></section>
<div class="apdp-sticky" data-apdp-sticky hidden><div class="apdp-sticky__product"><span>Altaeron™ AirRelief <b data-apdp-sticky-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</b></span></div><button class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" type="button" data-apdp-sticky-submit{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}><span data-apdp-sticky-text>{{ cta_label | escape }}</span></button></div><script type="application/json" data-apdp-product-json>{{ product.variants | json }}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{{ product | structured_data }}</script></div>
